<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11673] SQL: It looks like security check is missed in h2 indexing.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11673</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Security check is no longer conducted in &lt;tt&gt;IgniteH2Indexing#executeSelect0&lt;/tt&gt; after &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10104&quot; title=&quot;MVCC TX: client SFU doesn&amp;#39;t work on replicated caches&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10104&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10104&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; having been merged.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
